<!DOCTYPE html><!-- SYNTHETIC FIXTURE: a new act whose closing section amends other acts, in the 2025 change-block markup; no Lovdata text. --><html lang="no"><head><title>Lov om prøvearkiv</title><base href="https://lovdata.no/" /></head><body><header class="documentHeader" id="hode"><dl class="data-document-key-info"><dt class="legacyID">Datokode</dt><dd class="legacyID">LOV-2025-06-20-996</dd><dt class="dokid">DokumentID</dt><dd class="dokid">LTI/lov/2025-06-20-996</dd><dt class="dateInForce">I kraft fra</dt><dd class="dateInForce">Kongen fastset</dd><dt class="changesToDocuments">Endrer</dt><dd class="changesToDocuments"><ul><li>lov/2021-06-18-121</li><li>lov/2007-12-14-116</li></ul></dd><dt class="dateOfPublication">Kunngjort</dt><dd class="dateOfPublication">2025-06-20 15:00</dd><dt class="title">Tittel</dt><dd class="title">Lov om prøvearkiv</dd><dt class="refid">RefID</dt><dd class="refid">lov/2025-06-20-996</dd></dl></header><main class="documentBody" data-lovdata-URL="LTI/lov/2025-06-20-996" id="dokument"><h1>Lov om prøvearkiv</h1><section class="section" data-name="kap1" id="kapittel-1"><h2>Kapittel 1. Innleiing</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§1" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1"><h3 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 1</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Føremål</span></h3><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Lova skal sikre arkiv.</article></article></section><section class="section" data-name="kap5" id="kapittel-5"><h2>Kapittel 5. Sluttføresegner</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§24" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-1"><h3 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 24</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Ikraftsetjing</span></h3><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Lova gjeld frå den tida Kongen fastset.</article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§25" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2"><h3 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 25</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Endringar i andre lover</span></h3><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-ledd-1">Frå den tida lova tek til å gjelde, blir desse endringane gjorde i andre lover:</article><article class="document-change" data-document="lov/2021-06-18-121" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-1"><article class="change" data-change-part="lov/2021-06-18-121/§26/ledd/6" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-1-endring-1"><article class="defaultP"><strong>1.</strong> I lov 18. juni 2021 nr. 121 om Stortingets ombud skal § 26 sjette ledd lyde:</article><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-1-endring-1-ledd-1">Prøvearkivlova gjeld for ombodet.</article></article></article><article class="document-change" data-document="lov/2007-12-14-116" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-2"><article class="change" data-change-part="lov/2007-12-14-116/§11" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-2-endring-1"><article class="defaultP"><strong>2.</strong> I lov 14. desember 2007 nr. 116 om studentsamskipnader skal § 11 lyde:</article><article class="futureLegalArticle" data-name="§11" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-2-endring-1-foreslåttparagraf-1"><span class="futureLegalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 11</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Forholdet til annen lovgivning</span></span><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-5-paragraf-2-dokumentendring-2-endring-1-foreslåttparagraf-1-ledd-1">Prøvearkivlova gjeld ikkje.</article></article></article></article></article></section></main></body></html>
